      "eb": "In depth",
      "h": "Technical SEO for sites with thousands of pages",
      "paras": [
        "On large sites, technical SEO problems multiply. One bad filter rule can create millions of crawlable URLs. One template error can drop structured data from every product page. A technical SEO audit finds those issues before they cost you rankings.",
        "We crawl the site at scale and review log files where available. The audit covers crawl budget, indexation, canonical tags, faceted navigation, pagination, redirects, Core Web Vitals, JavaScript rendering, structured data and international setup.",
        "Each issue is traced to the template or rule that causes it, sized by the number of URLs affected and ranked by impact. That makes it easy for developers to fix the cause once.",
        "Clean technical foundations also help AI visibility, since AI tools rely on the same crawlable, well-structured pages. Fixes can be delivered as a fixed-price job or inside a Build sprint."
